#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:659
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In addition, by clicking on the <guibutton>Configure...</guibutton> "
#| "button, you can bring up a dialog that will allow you to select which "
#| "components you want active from a list. By checking the box next to the "
#| "component title you select the component to be put into the side bar and "
#| "the summary view. The component is loaded and its main view is shown in "
#| "the main window when clicking on its icon in the side pane for the first "
#| "time. By unchecking the check box the component is removed from the side "
#| "pane and summary view. Changes become effective by clicking the "
#| "<guibutton>Apply</guibutton> or <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button."
msgid ""
"By checking the box next to the component title you select the component to "
"be visible in the Side Pane and the Summary View. The component is loaded "
"and shown in the Main Window when clicking on its icon in the Side Pane. By "
"unchecking the check box the component is removed from the Side Pane and "
"Summary View. Changes become effective by clicking the <guibutton>Apply</"
"guibutton> or <guibutton>OK</guibutton> buttons."
msgstr ""
"លើ​ពីនេះ ចុច​លើ​ប៊ូតុង <guibutton>កំណត់រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ​...</guibutton> អ្នក​អាច​បង្ហាញ​​ប្រអប់​ដែលវា​"
"អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​ជ្រើស​សមាសភាគ​ពី​បញ្ជី​ដែលអ្នកចង់​ឲ្យ​វា​សកម្ម​ ។ ដោយ​ចុច​លើ​ប្រអប់​​ចំណង​ជើង​សមាសភាគបន្ទាប់​  "
"ហើយ​អ្នកជ្រើស​សមាសភាគ​មួយ​ដើម្បី​ដាក់វា​ទៅ​ក្នុង​របារចំហៀង​ និង​ទិដ្ឋភាព​សង្ខេប​ ។ សមាសភាគ​បានផ្ទុក​​"
"ទិដ្ឋភាពមេ​របស់វា​​ដែល​បានបង្ហាញ​ក្នុង​បង្អួច​មេ​ ពេលអ្នកចុច​​លើ​រូបតំណាង​របស់វា​ជា​លើក​ដំបូង​។ ដោះធីក​ពី​"
"ប្រអប់សមាសភាគ​វា​ត្រូវ​បាន​យក​ចេញ​ពី​បន្ទះ​ចំហៀង​ និង​ទិដ្ឋភាព ​សង្ខេប ។ ការផ្លាស់ប្តូរ​នេះមានប្រសិទ្ធភាព​"
"លុះត្រាតែ​អ្នកចុច​ប៊ូតុង​ <guibutton>អនុវត្ត</guibutton> ឬ <guibutton>យល់ព្រម​</guibutton> ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:668
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can also configure individual components by activating the component "
#| "by clicking on the corresponding icon in the side pane of the main window "
#| "and then selecting the menu item <guimenuitem>Configure "
#| "<replaceable>application name</replaceable></guimenuitem> from the "
#| "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu."
msgid ""
"You can also configure individual components by clicking on the "
"corresponding icon in the Side Pane and then selecting the menu item "
"<guimenuitem>Configure <replaceable>application name</replaceable></"
"guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
